S|               EXT. CLEARING - DAY                                                  
N|               Snow drifts across the bodies of the fallen dead. Eight              
N|               corpses lie frozen on the ground-- men, women, and children,         
N|               wearing heavy furs. The wind whips through their long hair.          
O|
N,I|               At the edge of the clearing, WILL (20), a young ranger               
N,I|               dressed all in black, surveys the grim scene from the back of        
N|               his gelding. He gathers his reins and guides his horse south.        
O|
S|               EXT. FOREST - DUSK                                                   
O|
N|               Will rides hard between the towering pines, his horse's              
N|               hooves kicking up fresh-fallen snow.                                 
N|               He comes to a halt and dismounts beside two tethered horses.         
N,I|               His comrades, GARED (50) and SER WAYMARR OYCE (18), crouch           
N|               beside a stream, filling their skins with cold water. They           
N|               rise and look to the newcomer expectantly.                           
O|
N|               Ser Waymar is gray-eyed and graceful, with an aristocrat's           
N|               air of command despite his youth. He wears a supple coat of          
N|               gleaming black ringmail and a lush sable cloak.                      
O|
N|               Will and Gared also wear the black of the Night's Watch, but         
N|               their clothes are far less regal, their leather and fur              
N|               battered from hard usage. Gared wears a hood for warmth.             
C|                                   WILL                                             
U|                         We should start back. They're all                          
U|                         dead.                                                      
O|
N|               Gared offers Will his water skin and Will takes a drink.             
O|
