N|               beautiful weapon, centuries old. Theon is the only man in the        
N|               party wearing a kraken sigil instead of a dire wolf.                 
N,I|               Ned peels off his gloves and hands them to JORY CASSEL (30s),        
N,I|               a bull-necked warrior with a heavy mustache.                         
O|
