N,G|               responds. We watch this exchange from the boys' perspective.         
O|
N|               Gared's final words clearly trouble Ned, who studies the             
N|               condemned man's face, judging his honesty.                           
O|
N|               Bran watches from afar, his head slightly cocked, trying to          
N|               make out what Gared is saying.                                       
N|               There is a great weariness in Ned's eyes as he places both           
N|               hands on the hilt of his greatsword.                                 
